# Experiment 5 — allow much more rewriting at the cleanup step.
#
# Safer than experiment 4: cleanup has always been allowed to repair, and
# nothing here touches the stitching contract downstream. The directive asks for
# sentence-internal repair; changes.diff already records every change, and
# churn_pct in each bundle's meta.json is the number that says how much more
# this actually moved.
#
#   bin/ab.sh run cleanup-licence    (offline, on frozen fixtures)
#   BLOG_PROFILE=cleanup-loose bin/reclean.sh drafts/2026-08-11-x
CLEANUP_DIRECTIVE=$BLOG_REPO_DIR/profiles/directives/cleanup-loose.md
